hadra+Majhi+Lok+Sabha+MP+oath+2024","status":"search_link_only","yt_id":null},"source_profile":"https://sansad.in/ls/members/biographyM/4796","source_positions":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=4796&locale=en","positions":[{"period":"25 Feb 2026 Onwards","position":"Member, India– Portugal Parliamentary Friendship Group","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=4796&locale=en"},{"period":"26-Sep-2024 onwards","position":"Member, committee on Railways","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=4796&locale=en"},{"period":"June 2024","position":"Elected to 18th Lok Sabha","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=4796&locale=en"},{"period":"","position":"Member, Consultative Committee, Ministry of Consumer Affairs, Food and Public Distribution","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=4796&locale=en"},{"period":"1 Sep. 2014 onwards","position":"Member, Standing Committee on Railways","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=4796&locale=en"},{"period":"14 Aug. 2014 - 30 April 2016","position":"Member, Committee on Welfare of Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=4796&locale=en"},{"period":"May, 2014","position":"Elected to 16th Lok Sabha","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=4796&locale=en"}],"local_photo":"/data/photos/4796.jpg","mpid":4796,"house":"Lok Sabha","member_key":"ls-4796","marriage_date":"11-Mar-1992","literary_activities":"","other_information":"While in service in Railways, completed and commissioned :\nRestoration of cyclone damaged railway track between Rahama-Paradeep, 23 Km in record number of 20 days in Nov, 1999; Sambalpur-Talcher New Railway line -175 Km in Odisha during 1998; Raipur-Bhilai 3rd line (2003) - 25 Km; and Gadag-Bagalkot Gauge Conversion - 90 Km in Karnataka during 2008. \nAt present the constituency is ranked 543rd out of 543 co